---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import heroImage from "../assets/ResonaraFull.jpg";
import logoImage from "../assets/ResonaraLogo.png";
---

<Layout title="Resonara — Sound Nirvana">
  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="flex items-center justify-between px-8 py-6 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <img src={logoImage.src} width="32" height="32" alt="Resonara logo" class="h-8 w-8" loading="eager" />
      <span class="text-sm font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-foreground">Resonara</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- ═══════════ HERO ═══════════ -->
    <section class="px-8 pt-16 pb-24 md:px-16 lg:px-24 xl:pt-24 xl:pb-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <div class="grid items-center gap-16 lg:grid-cols-2">
          <!-- Copy -->
          <div class="max-w-xl">
            <h1 class="text-balance text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Sound Nirvana</h1>
            <p class="mt-4 text-lg tracking-wide text-muted-foreground md:text-xl">Silence of Mind. Science of Sound.</p>
            <p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
              Resonara explores the intersection of acoustics, material science, and focused attention. Each bowl is tuned, measured, and finished by hand in small batches.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Image -->
          <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg">
            <img src={heroImage.src} width={heroImage.width} height={heroImage.height} alt="A Resonara singing bowl resting on a stone surface" class="h-auto w-full object-cover" loading="eager" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ DIVIDER ═══════════ -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
      <hr class="border-border" />
    </div>

    <!-- ═══════════ BENEFITS ═══════════ -->
    <section class="px-8 py-24 md:px-16 lg:px-24 xl:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground">What we investigate</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl">Benefits of Singing Bowls</h2>

        <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
          <!-- Card 1 -->
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-8">
            <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-muted text-muted-foreground">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M2 10v3"></path>
                <path d="M6 6v11"></path>
                <path d="M10 3v18"></path>
                <path d="M14 8v7"></path>
                <path d="M18 5v13"></path>
                <path d="M22 10v3"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-medium text-card-foreground">Acoustic Resonance</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
              Preliminary research explores how sustained tonal frequencies may support focused listening and a quieter mental environment.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 2 -->
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-8">
            <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-muted text-muted-foreground">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path>
                <path d="M2 12h20"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-medium text-card-foreground">Material Integrity</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
              We investigate how alloy composition and forging technique influence harmonic overtones, sustain length, and tonal warmth across each bowl.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Card 3 -->
          <div class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-8">
            <span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-muted text-muted-foreground">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 22c5.523 0 10-4.477 10-10S17.523 2 12 2 2 6.477 2 12s4.477 10 10 10z"></path>
                <path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-lg font-medium text-card-foreground">Focused Attention</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
              Ongoing studies explore whether rhythmic, predictable sound patterns may help listeners sustain attention during quiet, single-task work.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════ DIVIDER ═══════════ -->
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-8 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
      <hr class="border-border" />
    </div>

    <!-- ═══════════ TESTIMONIALS ═══════════ -->
    <section class="px-8 py-24 md:px-16 lg:px-24 xl:py-32">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground">What others say</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 text-balance text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-4xl">Testimonials</h2>

        <div class="mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <!-- Quote 1 -->
          <blockquote class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-8">
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-card-foreground">
              "I keep one on my desk. Five minutes with it before deep work and my mind quiets down noticeably. No magic — just a useful tool for focus."
            </p>
            <footer class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-muted"></div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-card-foreground">Elena Voss</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Industrial Designer</p>
              </div>
            </footer>
          </blockquote>

          <!-- Quote 2 -->
          <blockquote class="rounded-lg border border-border bg-card p-8">
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-card-foreground">
              "The sustain on these bowls is remarkably even. As an audio engineer, I appreciate that kind of tonal consistency — it speaks to careful material selection."
            </p>
            <footer class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-3">
              <div class="h-8 w-8 rounded-full bg-muted"></div>
              <div>
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-card-foreground">Marcus Tanaka</p>
                <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Audio Engineer</p>
              </div>
            </footer>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="px-8 py-12 md:px-16 lg:px-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
      <hr class="mb-8 border-border" />
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-4 md:flex-row">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium tracking-widest uppercase text-muted-foreground">Resonara</span>
        <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">Sound instruments, made carefully.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>
